 259+ 02D2              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 260+ 02D2              ; Unified guest memory interface
 261+ 02D2              ;
 262+ 02D2              ; Guest physical address is classified before selecting its physical backing:
 263+ 02D2              ;   00000-9FFFF / C8000-FDFFF : guest RAM, pages 44h-83h
 264+ 02D2              ;   A0000-BFFFF               : linear VGA aperture backing, pages 30h-37h
 265+ 02D2              ;   C0000-C7FFF               : VGA BIOS slot, pages 20h-21h
 266+ 02D2              ;   FE000-FFFFF               : system BIOS slot, page 10h (8 KiB image)
 267+ 02D2              ;
 268+ 02D2              ; The VGA aperture backend is deliberately a byte-linear staging layer over
 269+ 02D2              ; the first 128 KiB of the 256 KiB VRAM allocation. It is NOT yet IBM VGA
 270+ 02D2              ; plane/latch/read-mode/write-mode emulation. VGA register semantics are a
 271+ 02D2              ; separate implementation stage.
 272+ 02D2              ;
 273+ 02D2              ; All backing is reached through WIN3. A is the page bias for the address
 274+ 02D2              ; formula: page = (guest_high_nibble*4)+(guest_middle>>6)+bias.
