   5+ 2E1E              ; Initial deterministic test device:
   6+ 2E1E              ;   port 00E0h: 16-bit read/write latch (byte accesses use low lane).
   7+ 2E1E              ; Unmapped reads return FFh/FFFFh; unmapped writes are ignored.
   8+ 2E1E              ; Guest FLAGS and CPU registers are never changed by the backend.
